[TITLE]
Rain gage and subcatchment public behavior coverage.

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS           CFS
INFILTRATION         HORTON
FLOW_ROUTING         KINWAVE
LINK_OFFSETS         DEPTH
START_DATE           01/01/2020
START_TIME           00:00:00
REPORT_START_DATE    01/01/2020
REPORT_START_TIME    00:00:00
END_DATE             01/01/2020
END_TIME             00:20:00
REPORT_STEP          00:01:00
WET_STEP             00:01:00
DRY_STEP             00:01:00
ROUTING_STEP         00:00:30

[RAINGAGES]
Gage-A INTENSITY 0:01 1.0 TIMESERIES RainSeries
Gage-B INTENSITY 0:01 1.0 TIMESERIES RainSeries

[SUBCATCHMENTS]
Sub-Node   Gage-A J1       1.0 25 100 1.0 0
Sub-To-Sub Gage-A Sub-Node 0.5 50  75 2.0 5
Sub-Self   Gage-B Sub-Self 0.2  0  50 0.5 0

[SUBAREAS]
Sub-Node   0.01 0.1 0.05 0.05 25 OUTLET
Sub-To-Sub 0.01 0.1 0.05 0.05 25 OUTLET
Sub-Self   0.01 0.1 0.05 0.05  0 OUTLET

[INFILTRATION]
Sub-Node   3.0 0.5 4.0 7.0 0
Sub-To-Sub 3.0 0.5 4.0 7.0 0
Sub-Self   3.0 0.5 4.0 7.0 0

[JUNCTIONS]
J1 10 5 0 0 0

[OUTFALLS]
Out 0 FREE NO

[CONDUITS]
Pipe J1 Out 100 0.013 0 0 0 0

[XSECTIONS]
Pipe CIRCULAR 2 0 0 0 1

[TIMESERIES]
RainSeries 00:00 0
RainSeries 00:01 0.1
RainSeries 00:20 0

[REPORT]
INPUT NO
CONTROLS NO
SUBCATCHMENTS ALL
NODES ALL
LINKS ALL
